    "description": "Title\n: Antique Utility Insulator Glass Electric Pole Clear Blue Lot Assorted Lot\nOptional title\n: Vintage Glass Electrical Insulators Clear & Blue Set\nColor\n: Clear and blue\nDepartment\n: Antiques\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: Vintage Glass Utility Electric Pole Insulators Clear Blue Glass\nCondition\n: Fair - shows sign of wear\nApproximate measurements (inches)\n: 11L x 7W x 5H\nWeight (approximate)\n: 5.4 lbs\nDescription\n: Add antique charm to your collection with this set of 5 vintage glass utility electric pole insulators in clear and blue hues. These authentic insulators, once used on electrical poles to support wires, showcase time-tested craftsmanship with durable molded glass. The set includes three clear and two blue pieces, varying in size and shape, offering both visual interest and historical value. Each insulator features authentic wear and embossed lettering, echoing its original industrial use while providing a distinctive look for display or creative repurposing. Ideal for collectors, decorators, or anyone seeking unique antique decor, these glass insulators offer both decorative and historical appeal. Backed by our commitment to authenticity, these vintage glass pieces are sustainably sourced and perfect for adding character to your home or collection.\nVintage Glass Utility Electric Pole Insulators Clear Blue Glass",
